    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can twist your features into a startling mask.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Shapeshift Species Trait</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check against one opponent that can see you. If the check equals or exceeds the opponent's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>, you move the target 1 square away from you and it takes a -1 penalty on all attacks until the start of your next turn. This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> Fear effect.</p>",
